Third-party material
====================

Third-party material in this repository keeps its own terms and is NOT
covered by the MIT license above:

  * frontend/data/learn/lessons, practice.json, cheatsheet.json
      Lesson content from edriso/learn-tajweed — 0BSD.
      Qur'anic words inside them come from the Quran.com API and remain
      subject to the Quran Foundation terms.
  * frontend/data/learn/mutun.json
      Texts of Tuhfat al-Atfal and al-Muqaddimah al-Jazariyyah from Arabic
      Wikisource, line-numbered by mwiederrecht/ghunna — MIT.
  * frontend/fonts/UthmanicHafs1Ver18.woff2
      KFGQPC Uthmanic Script Hafs — King Fahd Glorious Qur'an Printing Complex.
  * Data fetched at runtime (Qur'an text, tajweed markup, recitations, word
    timings) from Quran.com / QDC — subject to the Quran Foundation terms.
